<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Siderca started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Siderca started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston analyst Michael Moskowitz has started coverage of Argentine pipe maker Siderca SACI with a rating of hold.</p>
<p>-- In an April 25 report, he said he assigned the rating because of Siderca's &quot;fair valuations, single-digit operating cash flow growth, weak outlook for domestic demand and increased global competition.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
